     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n      <div>Hello All,<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        We are excited to announce <b>MAD 2.0</b>!<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Some things will be the same (the time! and usually the place),\r\n        but other things will be different. Our first week (<b>Oct 2</b>)\r\n        will launch with an introduction and how-to, so <b>please come\r\n          by if you&#39;d like to participate this quarter</b>! We&#39;ll send a\r\n        reminder with more info next week.<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <b>Description</b><br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Meet and Analyze Data (MAD) is a community focused on tackling\r\n        biological big data questions ranging from high level concepts (<i>what\r\n          is metagenome assembly?</i>) to low level coding problems (<i>what\r\n          does this error message even mean!?</i>) and everything in\r\n        between. Each week will start with a short lesson to share\r\n        important tools for project management and data analysis\r\n        designed to help us level up our skills. Then, participants with\r\n        expertise in a variety of areas will be available to help with\r\n        individual research and coding questions. To facilitate this\r\n        discussion, all questions must be posted on the <a href=\"https://mad.oxli.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mad.oxli.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465750329000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1GwQvYYH3r6Tvedwn05rN4\">MAD\r\n          discourse forum</a>. Help us help you: please try to post your\r\n        questions ahead of time, and be kind to our helpers as they try\r\n        to get to all the questions! To keep things fun for everyone,\r\n        please check out our <a href=\"http://ivory.idyll.org/lab/coc.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ivory.idyll.org/lab/coc.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465750329000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yek5-4BJs5ILOeMuEnMXW\">Code of Conduct</a>.<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        <b>Schedule</b><br>\r\n        <table dir=\"ltr\" style=\"table-layout:fixed;width:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border:medium none\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\r\n          <colgroup><col width=\"91\"><col width=\"298\"></colgroup><tbody>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Date</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Topic</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">2-Oct</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">MAD 2.0: how to help us help you</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">9-Oct</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">What is the shell? </td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">16-Oct</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Practical software management with\r\n                conda, Pt 1</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">23-Oct</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">no MAD</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">30-Oct</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Practical software management with\r\n                conda, Pt 2</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">6-Nov</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Project organization and management</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">13-Nov</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">How to backup data on a remote\r\n                computer</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">20-Nov</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Quick sequencing data insights with\r\n                sourmash</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">27-Nov</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Thanksgiving -- no MAD</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">4-Dec</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Automation with Snakemake, Pt 1</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n            <tr style=\"height:21px\">\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">11-Dec</td>\r\n              <td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Automation with Snakemake, Pt 2</td>\r\n            </tr>\r\n          </tbody>\r\n        </table>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div><br>\r\n        Best,<br>\r\n      </div>\r\n      Your Friendly Neighborhood DIB Lab<br clear=\"all\">\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div width=\"1\" style=\"color:white;clear:both\">_._,_._,</div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n"
